  "control": "A has the same coordinator and consistency fixes as B, with the static RenderResult.canReconcile capability omitted. The exact transformation is in static-preparation-baseline.diff. Each run starts a fresh Chromium process and executes all nine cases.",
  "limits": [
    "Local, non-dedicated host; seven timing samples after five warmups per case. No CI timing threshold or proof of global optimality.",
    "Native construction counters run separately after timing samples.",
    "After the comparison, a helper comment and the Signal guide were clarified. Rebuilding B produced byte-identical JavaScript artifacts; source maps are not included in that equality check."
  ],
